                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "While the game looks great and often plays fine, the scoring is sometimes completely wrong against the AI.  It will sometimes switch your score with the AI score for some rounds. Not only that, but the AI is very VERY dumb.  It NEVER SCORED POSITIVE POINTS against me in the first 10 games I played against it.  This is mostly a complete waste of your time and money, so avoid this game.  Take the $10 and put it toward purchasing the real game instead.\n\nThis was published in 2018 and STILL has these issues after 8 years!! Blueline Games quite obviously doesn't care and will not be fixing it, so don't buy this game hoping for that.\n\n*EDIT* On my 11th play, the AI finally finished with above zero. One point to be exact.  It's really really bad.",
